	(text "POWER SWITCH SIGNAL POLARITY\n\n*_EN   Active high: high turns the rail on.\n       100k pull-down keeps the rail off during reset.\n\n*_FLT  Active low, open drain: low means overcurrent\n       or overtemperature. 100k pull-up to FMU_VDD_3V3."
